      "text": "[7PM] #Badagry #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth traffic flow from Custom Checkpoint to Agbara, inward Morogbo, extending down to Ajibade.\nOdofa, Church Gate, Ibiye, Magbon, en route Oko Afo, Elijah, Age Mowo, Mowo, Aradagun, Ibereko, all the way to Badagry Roundabout is also smooth. \n\nEfficient movement from Badagry Roundabout, connecting Joseph Dosu Way.\nGood traffic conditions on the return journey.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
