      "text": "Heavy Rainfall Warning No. 2 #NCR_PRSD\nWeather System: Southwest Monsoon (Habagat) and Low Pressure Area (LPA)\nIssued at: 2:00 AM, 08 June 2025(Sunday)\n\nORANGE WARNING LEVEL: Laguna, Quezon, Rizal, Metro Manila, Batangas, Bulacan and Cavite.\nASSOCIATED HAZARD: FLOODING is still THREATENING.\n\nYELLOW WARNING LEVEL: Zambales, Bataan, Tarlac, Pampanga and Nueva Ecija.\nASSOCIATED HAZARD: FLOODING in flood-prone areas.\nThe public and the Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Offices concerned are advised to MONITOR the weather condition and watch for the next warning to be issued at 5:00 AM today.\nFor more information and queries, please call telephone numbers 8927-1335 and 8927-2877 or log on to https://t.co/59mTpZJq1n.",
