      "text": "[7:21PM] #Ojo #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood vehicular movement from Agbara Customs Checkpoint down to Federal Road Safety Corps Office, Ijanikin.\nSlow movement between Tipper Garage and Iyana Era, with steady movement from Iyana Era onwards to Iyana Isashi.\nEfficient traffic flow from Iyana Isashi inward to Afromedia, and further down to Iyana Iba inward to Volks.\nSmooth movement on both Iyana Iba Flyover inward to Mile 2 and underneath the flyover inward to Igando.\nSteady vehicular movement from Volks down to Barracks, with encouraging traffic conditions from Barracks down to Abule Ado.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
