      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1931420320738541990",
      "text": "[7:32PM] #Mushin #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood vehicular movement from Moshalasi Alakara Police Station to Idi Oro Conoil, down to Olosha Ogunmokun LUTH Junction.\nAppreciable traffic flow from Ojuwoye towards Post Office, AP Olorunshogo, all the way to Oshodi Underneath Bridge.\nEfficient movement from Train Station towards Brown Junction Arena, with a similarly good traffic condition on the return journey from Bolade Oshodi Brown Junction to Goro Underneath Bridge.\nSmooth traffic flow on Oshodi Oke descending to Goro by Terminal 2, and underneath bridge ascending to Oshodi Oke by Terminal 1.\nGood movement at Olupese Cappa all the way to Ojuwoye LUTH Junction, Olosha Idi Oro, down to Moshalasi.\nGood traffic conditions from Ojuwoye connecting to Isolo Road, down to Palm Avenue, Tetrazzini, Oye Roundabout to Daleko Bridge and LASUTECH, with a similarly good return journey back to Mushin Ile Epo Isale.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
