      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1931428317053194742",
      "text": "[8:05PM] #AirportRd #TrafficUpdate \n\nSteady vehicular movement from NNPC Junction inward to Canoe, extending through Chivita, Lookman Atobajehun, Swimming Pool, Hollandia Way, Ajibade Babatola, and Eleganza Roundabout, connecting to Asa Afariogun Street inward to Lateef Salami Street.\nGood traffic flow from Awoniyi Elemo Junction, Fatai Irawo Junction, inward the main carriageway, towards 7&8 Junction.\nEfficient movement from Aye Junction inward to Osolo Way, Aswani Market, down to Aswani Roundabout, and further down to Asa Afariogun Junction by OZDE Plaza, managed by alternating traffic signals.\nSmooth traffic conditions on Oshodi Express inward to Apakun Nacho International Airport Road, with both inward and outward main carriageways moving efficiently.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
